  "recognized_text": "Hi there. Can I help? Yes, please. I was going to take the metro to Central Square, but the gates are closed. What's happening? I'm afraid the green line is closed this morning for repairs. When do you need to be there? At 10:00. I have a job interview, and I really don't want to be late. Okay. There's a free shuttle bus every 10 minutes. It takes about 25 minutes, or you can take a taxi. That's about 15 minutes and costs around $15. If I take the shuttle, will I get there before 10:00? Yes. The next one leaves in 5 minutes, so you should arrive at about 9:50. That's fine. And it's free? I'll take the shuttle. Where do I catch it? Right outside this exit, next to the flower shop. Perfect. Outside this exit, next to the flower shop. Thanks a lot. You're welcome. Good luck with your interview.",
  "source_text": "Hi there. Can I help? Yes, please. I was going to take the metro to Central Square, but the gates are closed. What's happening? I'm afraid the green line is closed this morning for repairs. When do you need to be there? At ten. I have a job interview, and I really don't want to be late. Okay. There's a free shuttle bus every ten minutes. It takes about twenty-five minutes. Or you can take a taxi. That's about fifteen minutes and costs around fifteen dollars. If I take the shuttle, will I get there before ten? Yes. The next one leaves in five minutes, so you should arrive at about nine fifty. That's fine, and it's free. I'll take the shuttle. Where do I catch it? Right outside this exit, next to the flower shop. Perfect. Outside this exit, next to the flower shop. Thanks a lot! You're welcome. Good luck with your interview!",
  "source_turns": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Hi there. Can I help?"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Yes, please. I was going to take the metro to Central Square, but the gates are closed. What's happening?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "I'm afraid the green line is closed this morning for repairs. When do you need to be there?"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "At ten. I have a job interview, and I really don't want to be late."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Okay. There's a free shuttle bus every ten minutes. It takes about twenty-five minutes. Or you can take a taxi. That's about fifteen minutes and costs around fifteen dollars."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "If I take the shuttle, will I get there before ten?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Yes. The next one leaves in five minutes, so you should arrive at about nine fifty."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "That's fine, and it's free. I'll take the shuttle. Where do I catch it?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Right outside this exit, next to the flower shop."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Perfect. Outside this exit, next to the flower shop. Thanks a lot!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "You're welcome. Good luck with your interview!"
    }
  ],
